CricketCoach AI database migrations

Alembic is the schema source of truth. Run commands from the backend directory:

    python -m alembic upgrade head
    python -m alembic current
    python -m alembic check

The initial migration creates the full application schema and enables PostgreSQL
row-level security on the public application tables. It creates no Data API
grants or policies. Future schema changes should be committed as new Alembic
revisions. Do not use SQLAlchemy metadata.create_all() to initialize a hosted
database. Analysis progress is derived from persisted jobs and drill completions;
there is no dedicated progress table.
